{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">銅鑼灣有餐廳傳出異味，多名員工不適送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事餐廳位於駱克道恆景大廈，消防車及消防人員到在場，部分人到餐廳及附近後巷，亦有警員在場調查事件。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ODD.SMELL-2230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264adrWnNbHE1790783258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ODD.SMELL-2230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指晚上近9時接報，指涉案餐廳有8名員工聞到甲醛後感到不適，全部人清醒，部分人送往律敦治醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T16:39:42.683343+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}